The future land use map designates this lot as
Community Business. The Community Business
category emphasizes a range of retail and office
uses to serve neighborhoods and the community
and region, and some align with designated
Commercial/Regional Activity Centers. Many of the
Community Business areas are already established
and thriving, while others are in need of future
